# Build context for backend/Dockerfile (the repository root). Allowlist: only what the
# API image needs is sent to Docker. The frontend image builds from frontend/ with its
# own .dockerignore.
**
!backend/pyproject.toml
!backend/uv.lock
!backend/.python-version
!backend/src/
!artifacts/lightgbm/
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
